/ActualText (Maintaining a healthy diet in Sri Lanka is challenging due to cultural food preferences, varying income levels, and unique dietary needs. Many struggle to find affordable, nutritious meal plans and personalized nutrition guidance that considers health concerns, allergies, fitness goals, and budget constraints is often lacking.)
